    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compass of Destiny: Survivors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using assets from Compass of Destiny: Istanbul, Survivors mode is a special game mode that heavily features action and survival elements. Set in the mystical atmosphere of Istanbul, players must survive against ever-increasing waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features of the mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Waves of Enemies:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players face more challenging and diverse enemies with each wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic and Infinite Maps:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various maps set in different locations offer players different strategies. From rural areas to historic streets, the game is played in a variety of areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment and Power-ups:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can earn new equipment, upgrade existing abilities and gain unique powers between waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Unlocked Over Time:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can unlock new enemies, equipment and abilities as they reach certain levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time you survive, the number of enemies you kill, and the level you reach determine your score. This increases competition and encourages players to perform better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy Advice:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina and limited power carefully. Enemies become more dangerous as you progress, so making the right investments in power-ups is critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the map's features to gain an advantage in tight spaces or scatter enemies in wide areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors mode offers gamers a fast-paced, exciting and highly replayable experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compass of Destiny: Survivors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using assets from Compass of Destiny: Istanbul, Survivors mode is a special game mode that heavily features action and survival elements. Set in the mystical atmosphere of Istanbul, players must survive against ever-increasing waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features of the mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Waves of Enemies:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players face more challenging and diverse enemies with each wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic and Infinite Maps:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various maps set in different locations offer players different strategies. From rural areas to historic streets, the game is played in a variety of areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment and Power-ups:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can earn new equipment, upgrade existing abilities and gain unique powers between waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Unlocked Over Time:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can unlock new enemies, equipment and abilities as they reach certain levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time you survive, the number of enemies you kill, and the level you reach determine your score. This increases competition and encourages players to perform better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy Advice:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina and limited power carefully. Enemies become more dangerous as you progress, so making the right investments in power-ups is critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the map's features to gain an advantage in tight spaces or scatter enemies in wide areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors mode offers gamers a fast-paced, exciting and highly replayable experience.</p>",
